# Get your free access key at https://web3forms.com — sign up, verify your
# destination email (rbarakhvostov@gmail.com), then copy the Access Key from
# your dashboard and add allow-listed domain(s) there too.
# This key is safe to expose client-side (Web3Forms enforces domain allow-listing
# per key), but keep it out of source control anyway — copy this file to .env
# and put your real key there.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=replace-with-your-web3forms-access-key
